to CAST Conversations

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.740
with Jay Scheib and Rian Flynn.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.860
We'll begin with an excerpt
from World of wires directed

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.400
by Jay Scheib at MIT in 2018.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.500
A longer version of the
video will be played

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.673
at the end of this conversation

