or anything like that, all right
extraction phase nobody's here

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:59.120
ready in three, two and one

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.390
OH, Wow.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:09.780
So I'm here and I can see
you but you can't see me.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:10.490
Hi.

